# Evidence (docs/slimdown-plan.md): only Markdown reports are committed under artifacts/. Raw run output (screenshots,
# traces, logs, JSON, helper scripts) goes to CI artifacts or the PR, never to git: it was 2,800 files / 184 MB by 2026-10-10.
/artifacts/**
!/artifacts/**/
!/artifacts/**/*.md
# raw helper-agent transcripts and helper CLI output stay out even as Markdown (DV2-02)
artifacts/**/codex-stderr*
artifacts/**/codex-stdout*
artifacts/**/helper-logs/
# Local gate runs (scripts/gate.mjs); summarise a run in a Markdown report under artifacts/<area>/ to keep it as evidence
artifacts/gates/
